WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.126
Riley: Thanks for the dog treats!

2
00:00:17.127 --> 00:00:21.338
Mr. Lin: Come back soon!

3
00:00:21.339 --> 00:00:24.103
Theo: I bought a leash for Whiskers.

4
00:00:24.104 --> 00:00:28.789
Kelli: Ha-ha! Whoever heard of a leash for a hamster?

5
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.077
Sarah: I think it's cute.

6
00:00:31.078 --> 00:00:36.354
Kelli: Be careful. He's getting tangled in it.

7
00:00:36.355 --> 00:00:38.851
Skyler: What are you doing, Ben?

8
00:00:38.852 --> 00:00:43.881
Ben: I'm blowing up a balloon for Speedy.

9
00:00:43.882 --> 00:00:47.303
Ben: See? I tie the string around him.

10
00:00:47.304 --> 00:00:51.600
Ben: Now he won't get lost in the tall grass!

11
00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:54.994
Riley: What a great idea.

12
00:00:54.995 --> 00:00:59.365
Sarah: Chatter is pecking at Speedy's balloon.

13
00:00:59.366 --> 00:01:03.295
Skyler: Chatter, stop!

14
00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:06.211
Theo: Chatter popped Speedy's balloon!

15
00:01:06.212 --> 00:01:10.106
Ben: Oh well. I'll just carry him.

16
00:01:10.107 --> 00:01:16.116
I don't want him to get lost.

17
00:01:16.117 --> 00:01:19.824
Skyler: Let's choose pet tricks for our show.

18
00:01:19.825 --> 00:01:22.576
Riley: Snooks can play hide-and-seek.

19
00:01:22.577 --> 00:01:26.767
I hide his bone, and he looks for it.

20
00:01:26.768 --> 00:01:30.932
Riley: He even checks the closet.

21
00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:35.385
Theo: Frankie can jump through a hoop.

22
00:01:35.386 --> 00:01:37.989
Sarah: Mittens can do flips.

23
00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:41.002
Of course Mittens isn't a real pet.

24
00:01:41.003 --> 00:01:44.883
Riley: That's still a good trick.

25
00:01:44.884 --> 00:01:47.828
Skyler: Chatter can tell a story.

26
00:01:47.829 --> 00:01:49.678
Chatter: Once upon a time . . .

27
00:01:49.679 --> 00:01:55.132
Skyler: Shh, Chatter. Not yet!

28
00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:58.190
Ben: Maybe Speedy and I will just watch.

29
00:01:58.191 --> 00:02:01.038
He still doesn't know any tricks.

30
00:02:01.039 --> 00:02:04.732
Riley: I think Speedy should be in the pet show.

31
00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:09.535
Sarah: Me too! Everyone loves him.

32
00:02:09.536 --> 00:02:11.980
Theo: Don't worry, Ben.

33
00:02:11.981 --> 00:02:14.713
Riley: We're the Pet Lovers Club.

34
00:02:14.714 --> 00:02:19.934
We'll think of something Speedy can do!
